# Azure AI Foundry Configuration
# See docs/SETUP.md for how to obtain these values.

# Required: Foundry project endpoint
# Format: https://<resource>.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/<project>
FOUNDRY_PROJECT_ENDPOINT=

# Required: Model deployment name (determined during Gate 1 setup)
# Do NOT hardcode a default — discover available models first.
FOUNDRY_MODEL=
